# Compact Use-Case Diagram — entity-centric, three-level

> **Three levels.**
> **Left** — actor hierarchy (`User` → `Employee` → concrete roles).
> **Centre** — action nodes `([...])` that absorb the role × verb explosion.
>   An action node is introduced whenever ≥ 2 roles share the same verb(s)
>   on the same entity; single-role single-verb interactions stay as direct
>   arrows to the entity.
> **Right** — domain entities, grouped by subdomain.
>
> **Inheritance.** `User` and `Employee` carry the actions every role in
> their subtree inherits. Concrete roles only add their *own* additional
> actions. Dashed arrows inside the actor column show "extends".

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    %% ============================================================
    %%  STYLES
    %% ============================================================
    classDef abst  fill:#F8F9FA,stroke:#6C757D,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#000
    classDef stud  fill:#FDEBD0,stroke:#D35400,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef emp   fill:#D6EAF8,stroke:#2980B9,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef priv  fill:#F4ECF7,stroke:#8E44AD,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef cap   fill:#E8F8F5,stroke:#1ABC9C,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 3,color:#000
    classDef act   fill:#EBF5FB,stroke:#2E86C1,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000
    classDef ent   fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#000
    classDef sub   fill:#FEF9E7,stroke:#B7950B,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000

    %% ============================================================
    %%  ACTORS & HIERARCHY  (left column)
    %% ============================================================
    subgraph ACTORS [Actors]
        direction TB

        subgraph ABSTRACT [Abstract base roles]
            direction TB
            User((👤 User)):::abst
            Employee((💼 Employee)):::abst
            User -. extends .-> Employee
        end

        subgraph STU_GRP [Students]
            Student((🎓 Student / Grad)):::stud
        end

        subgraph EMP_GRP [Employees]
            direction TB
            Teacher((👨‍🏫 Teacher)):::emp
            Manager((📊 Manager)):::emp
            Dean((👔 Dean)):::priv
            Librarian((📚 Librarian)):::emp
            Tech((🛠️ TechSupport)):::emp
            EmpRes((🔬 EmpResearcher)):::emp
            Teacher -. extends .-> Dean
        end

        subgraph ADM_GRP [Administration]
            Admin((🛡️ Admin)):::priv
        end

        %% Subgraph nesting shows containment; key inheritance arrows only:
        User     -. extends .-> Student
        User     -. extends .-> Admin
        Employee -. extends .-> Teacher
        Employee -. extends .-> Manager
        Employee -. extends .-> Librarian
        Employee -. extends .-> Tech
        Employee -. extends .-> EmpRes

        %% Capability — opt-in for Student/Teacher/EmpRes
        Researcher{{🧪 Researcher}}:::cap
        Student -. become researcher .-> Researcher
        Teacher -. become researcher .-> Researcher
        EmpRes  -. always .-> Researcher
    end

    %% ============================================================
    %%  ENTITIES  (right column)
    %% ============================================================
    subgraph ACAD [📚 Academics]
        direction TB
        Course[Course]:::ent
        Lesson[Lesson]:::sub
        Grade[Grade]:::sub
        Transcript[Transcript]:::sub
        Request[Request]:::sub
    end

    subgraph LIB [📖 Library]
        Book[Book]:::ent
    end

    subgraph COMM [💬 Communication]
        direction TB
        News[News]:::ent
        Comment[Comment]:::sub
        Message[Message]:::ent
    end

    subgraph OPS [⚙️ Operations]
        direction TB
        Order[IT Order]:::ent
        Org[Organization]:::ent
        Account[User Account]:::ent
        Log[System Log]:::ent
    end

    subgraph RES [🔬 Research]
        direction TB
        Paper[Paper]:::ent
        Project[Project]:::ent
    end

    %% ============================================================
    %%  STRUCTURAL RELATIONS  (entity internals, dashed)
    %% ============================================================
    Lesson     -. belongs to .-> Course
    Grade      -. part of .->   Transcript
    Grade      -. for Student .-> Student
    Transcript -. summarises .-> Course
    Comment    -. on .->        News
    Request    -. may target .-> Course
    Paper      -. published in .-> Project

    %% ============================================================
    %%  ACTION NODES  (centre — pill shape)
    %%  Named AC_* to avoid collisions
    %% ============================================================

    %% --- Universal (every User) ---
    AC_BrowseCourses([Browse Courses]):::act
    AC_BrowseBooks([Browse Books]):::act
    AC_ReadNews([Read News]):::act
    AC_Message([Send / Read Message]):::act
    AC_Comment([Write Comment]):::act
    AC_SubmitRequest([Submit / Track Request]):::act
    AC_BrowseResearch([Browse Papers & Projects]):::act

    %% --- Employee-level (every Employee) ---
    AC_PublishNews([Publish / Pin News]):::act
    AC_SubmitOrder([Submit IT Order]):::act

    %% --- Shared: Student + Teacher ---
    AC_BorrowBook([Borrow / Return Book]):::act

    %% --- Shared: Teacher + Dean ---
    AC_Teach([Teach / View Taught Courses]):::act
    AC_ViewGrades([View Student Grades]):::act

    %% --- Shared: Manager + Dean ---
    AC_ProcessRequest([Approve / Reject Request]):::act
    AC_ViewAllRequests([View All Requests]):::act

    %% ============================================================
    %%  USER → ACTION NODES  (universal, abstract)
    %% ============================================================
    User --> AC_BrowseCourses
    User --> AC_BrowseBooks
    User --> AC_ReadNews
    User --> AC_Message
    User --> AC_Comment
    User --> AC_SubmitRequest
    User --> AC_BrowseResearch

    %% ============================================================
    %%  EMPLOYEE → ACTION NODES  (employee-level, abstract)
    %% ============================================================
    Employee --> AC_PublishNews
    Employee --> AC_SubmitOrder

    %% ============================================================
    %%  STUDENT  (own actions only — inherits User)
    %% ============================================================
    Student -->|enroll / drop| Course
    Student -->|view| Transcript
    Student --> AC_BorrowBook
    Student -->|create / join| Org
    Student -->|rate| Teacher

    %% ============================================================
    %%  TEACHER  (own actions + shared — inherits Employee)
    %% ============================================================
    Teacher --> AC_BorrowBook
    Teacher --> AC_Teach
    Teacher -->|record| Grade
    Teacher --> AC_ViewGrades
    Teacher -->|complain about| Student

    %% ============================================================
    %%  MANAGER  (own actions + shared — inherits Employee)
    %% ============================================================
    Manager -->|create / configure / delete| Course
    Manager -->|add| Lesson
    Manager -->|assign to course| Teacher
    Manager --> AC_ProcessRequest
    Manager --> AC_ViewAllRequests
    Manager -->|generate| Transcript

    %% ============================================================
    %%  DEAN  (extends Teacher — inherits Employee)
    %% ============================================================
    Dean --> AC_Teach
    Dean --> AC_ViewGrades
    Dean --> AC_ProcessRequest
    Dean --> AC_ViewAllRequests

    %% ============================================================
    %%  LIBRARIAN  (inherits Employee)
    %% ============================================================
    Librarian -->|add / remove| Book

    %% ============================================================
    %%  TECH SUPPORT  (inherits Employee)
    %% ============================================================
    Tech -->|view queue| Order
    Tech -->|accept / complete| Order

    %% ============================================================
    %%  ADMIN
    %% ============================================================
    Admin -->|create / delete| Account
    Admin -->|view| Log
    Admin -->|generate top-researcher| News

    %% ============================================================
    %%  RESEARCHER  (capability)
    %% ============================================================
    Researcher -->|publish| Paper
    Researcher -->|generate citation| Paper
    Researcher -->|create / join| Project
    Researcher -->|subscribe / unsubscribe| Project

    %% ============================================================
    %%  ACTION NODES → ENTITIES
    %% ============================================================
    AC_BrowseCourses --> Course
    AC_BrowseBooks   --> Book
    AC_ReadNews      --> News
    AC_Message       --> Message
    AC_Comment       --> Comment
    AC_SubmitRequest --> Request
    AC_BrowseResearch --> Paper
    AC_BrowseResearch --> Project
    AC_PublishNews   --> News
    AC_SubmitOrder   --> Order
    AC_BorrowBook    --> Book
    AC_Teach         --> Course
    AC_ViewGrades    --> Grade
    AC_ProcessRequest --> Request
    AC_ViewAllRequests --> Request
```

## Action node decision guide

An action node `([...])` is placed between roles and an entity when two or more
roles share the same verb set on that entity. Single-role single-verb interactions
use a direct labelled arrow.

| Action node | Roles that feed it | Why a node (not direct arrows) |
|---|---|---|
| Browse Courses | every role (`User`) | 9 roles × 1 verb = 9 arrows avoided |
| Browse Books | every role (`User`) | same |
| Read News | every role (`User`) | same |
| Send / Read Message | every role (`User`) | same |
| Write Comment | every role (`User`) | same |
| Submit / Track Request | every role (`User`) | same |
| Browse Papers & Projects | every role (`User`) | same |
| Publish / Pin News | 6 employees (`Employee`) | 6 arrows avoided |
| Submit IT Order | 6 employees (`Employee`) | 6 arrows avoided |
| Borrow / Return Book | Student + Teacher | 2 roles × 2 verbs = 4 arrows → 1 node |
| Teach / View Taught | Teacher + Dean | 2 roles share same relationship |
| View Student Grades | Teacher + Dean | 2 roles, same view |
| Approve / Reject Request | Manager + Dean | 2 roles × 2 verbs = 4 arrows → 1 node |
| View All Requests | Manager + Dean | 2 roles, same view |

## Inheritance

`User` and `Employee` carry the universal actions (action nodes they feed);
their subtree concrete roles inherit everything and only annotate their own
additions. This prevents repeating Browse Courses / Read News / etc. for
every individual role.

| Abstract | Extends from | Concrete members |
|---|---|---|
| `User` | — | Student/Grad, Admin, + all employees |
| `Employee` | `User` | Teacher, Manager, Dean, Librarian, TechSupport, EmpResearcher |
| `Dean` | `Teacher` (→`Employee`→`User`) | — (leaf) |
| `Researcher` | capability node, not a role | opt-in for Student/Teacher/EmpRes |
